    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s003-2/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s003-2/b8> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2969, djr:R-2970 ;
    djr:text "- TemplateView/Generic CBV/FBV 선택은 흐름 복잡도 기준, mixin이 깊어지면 재검토 (§2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s003-2/b9>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s004-3/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2971, djr:R-2972 ;
    djr:text "- context에는 표시 값만; 도메인 동작은 서비스/usecase boundary로 분리 (§3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s002-1/b10>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s005-4/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2973 ;
    djr:text "- 템플릿은 presentation과 presentation-related branching만 담당 (§4)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s007-6/b7>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s007-6/b8>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s011-10/b7> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2974 ;
    djr:text "- web form은 GET·valid POST·invalid POST·redirect·form error 경로를 모두 처리 (§6)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s008-7/b4> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2975 ;
    djr:text "- HTMX fragment는 method·auth·permission·CSRF를 function/class view와 동일하게 보호 (§7)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s009-8/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s009-8/b6> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2976 ;
    djr:text "- CSRF·XSS 설정과 보안 헤더는 Django 보안 프리미티브로 유지 (§8)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/references/final.md/s011-10/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2977, djr:R-2978 ;
    djr:text "- render acceptance 보고는 실제 실행한 검증만 기재, 미실행은 미실행으로 명시 (§10)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-web/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
